---
import Analytics from "../components/Analytics.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Privacy Policy – Vermont Fire Stations</title>
    <Analytics />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="badge" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none">
            <path
              d="M12 2.5c1.1 2.6-1.4 3.9-1.7 6.3-.2 1.7.9 3.2 2.6 3.2.4 0 .8-.1 1.1-.3-.3 2-2.1 3.5-4.2 3.5a4.3 4.3 0 0 1-4.3-4.3c0-3.6 2.9-5 3.6-7.7.3 1 .1 2-.4 2.8 1.6-.8 2.7-2.2 3.3-3.5Z"
              fill="currentColor"
            />
          </svg>
        </span>
        <span class="wordmark">
          <span class="title">Vermont Fire Stations</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated August 2026.</em></p>

      <p>Vermont Fire Stations has no accounts, no logins, and no forms. There is
        nothing here to sign up for and nothing for you to fill in, so no personal
        information is collected from you directly.</p>

      <p>The site does use <a href="https://marketingplatform.google.com/about/analytics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
        >Google Analytics</a> to count visits and see which stations and photographs
        people actually look at. It records the page you are on, how you arrived,
        your browser and device type, an approximate location (a city or region,
        worked out from your IP address, which Google discards rather than stores),
        and events such as scrolling, following a link off the site, and downloading
        a file. Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser so that repeat visits
        can be told apart from new ones. There is no advertising here, and none of
        this data is sold.</p>

      <p>If you would rather not be counted, Google publishes a
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">browser
        opt-out add-on</a>, and most content blockers stop the analytics script from
        loading at all.</p>

      <p>Map tiles are loaded directly from
        <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenStreetMap</a>'s
        servers as you use the map; their own privacy policy governs how they handle
        those requests.</p>

      <p>Station information, photographs, and locations are sourced from the
        <a href="https://geodata.vermont.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vermont E911 dataset (VCGI)</a>
        and contributed department photos, shown here for informational purposes.</p>

      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent via the <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.</p>

      <p><a href="/">← Back to the map</a></p>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Vermont Fire Stations</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    --red: #c62828;
    --ink: #2b2b2b;
    --paper: #faf7f2;
  }
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  html,
  body {
    height: 100%;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  header {
    padding: 0.65rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--red);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(43, 43, 43, 0.08);
  }
  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    width: fit-content;
  }
  .badge {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--red);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 38rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.25rem 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  main h1 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  main a {
    color: var(--red);
  }
  footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #6b6257;
    background: var(--paper);
    border-top: 1px solid #e7ded2;
  }
  footer a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  footer a:hover {
    color: var(--red);
  }
</style>
